                    485.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Genetic counseling requires: a knowledge of statistical genetics, an awareness of choices open to parents, and the psychological competence to deal with emotional trauma.",
            "block_bbox": [
